#: src/Support/MessageTemplates.php:2118
msgid "%d name was skipped because it was already on the guest list."
msgid_plural "%d names were skipped because they were already on the guest list."
msgstr[0] "%d naam is overgeslagen omdat die al op de gastenlijst stond."
msgstr[1] "%d namen zijn overgeslagen omdat ze al op de gastenlijst stonden."

